        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chuck, Sarah, Craig Turner, Laura Turner, Fred Willard, Swoosie Kurtz\n- Organizations: CIA\n- TV Episodes: Chuck Versus the Role Models\n- Topics: awards\n\nFacts:\n- In the TV episode \"Chuck Versus the Role Models,\" Chuck and Sarah are assigned to train under Craig Turner and Laura Turner.\n- Craig Turner and Laura Turner are a married CIA team with an impeccable record who hate one another.\n- Fred Willard portrays Craig Turner in \"Chuck Versus the Role Models.\"\n- Swoosie Kurtz portrays Laura Turner in \"Chuck Versus the Role Models.\"\n- Swoosie Kurtz is an Emmy Award winner and a two-time Tony Award winner.",
